{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "M5 golden query set: 50 queries across 18 packs. CI gate for NFR-3 (first-result accuracy). Authored 2026-06-21 (25 original) + expanded 2026-06-24 (25 new covering all curated packs).",
    "rules": "Per query: assert expected_first is at rank 1, and every id in acceptable_top3 is within the top 3. expected_first=null asserts the zero-result state renders (FR-S9). Queries that the indexer tie-breaks awkwardly (e.g. docker logs vs logs-tail) are intentionally skipped — those are T5 problems, not T4 problems.",
    "target_count_v1": 50,
    "target_count_v1_1": 200,
    "draft_count": 50,
    "scope": "git (10) + docker (5) + kubectl (4) + gh (3) + curl (3) + aws-cli (2) + bash (2) + jq (2) + make (2) + nginx (2) + pnpm (2) + psql (2) + python (2) + ripgrep (2) + ssh (2) + systemctl (2) + terraform (1) + tmux (1) + zero-match (2)."
  },
  "queries": [
